        "view": "escurel.knowledge",
        "contents": "Not connected to the escurel gateway.\n\n1. Set the gateway address.\n[Open the gateway setting](command:workbench.action.openSettings?%5B%22escurel.gatewayUrl%22%5D)\n\n2. Sign in, if your gateway asks for it.\n[Sign in](command:escurel.signIn)\n\n3. Try again.\n[Reconnect](command:escurel.refresh)\n\n[Get started](command:workbench.action.openWalkthrough?%7B%22category%22%3A%22datazoo.escurel%23escurel.start%22%7D)",
        "when": "escurel.connected == false && escurel.connectionState != 'quarantined' && escurel.connectionState != 'incompatible' && escurel.connectionState != 'unauthorized' && escurel.connectionState != 'unreachable'"
      },
      {
        "view": "escurel.knowledge",
        "contents": "The gateway did not accept your sign-in, or it has expired.\n[Sign in](command:escurel.signIn)\n[Check the gateway address](command:workbench.action.openSettings?%5B%22escurel.gatewayUrl%22%5D)",
        "when": "escurel.connected == false && escurel.connectionState == 'unauthorized'"
      },
      {
        "view": "escurel.knowledge",
        "contents": "The gateway could not be reached. Check that it is running and that the address is right (setting: escurel.gatewayUrl).\n[Open the gateway setting](command:workbench.action.openSettings?%5B%22escurel.gatewayUrl%22%5D)\n[Try again](command:escurel.refresh)",
        "when": "escurel.connected == false && escurel.connectionState == 'unreachable'"
